# False positives: these packages are only referenced in pip's own vendored
# CycloneDX SBOM (pip/_vendor/bom.cdx.json), used internally by pip for its
# build-isolation fallback. They are not actually installed in the image —
# `python3 -c "import setuptools"` / `import msgpack` both fail — so they are
# not exploitable here. Confirmed still present in pip 26.2.1 (latest as of
# 2026-08), so this is an upstream pip issue, not something we can fix by
# bumping our own dependencies.
CVE-2025-47273
GHSA-6v7p-g79w-8964
